      47.85,
      368.65,
      539.94,
      403.72
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 6(2)(b) and Section 21(2)(b) of the Town and Country Planning Ordinance(Chapter 269), I, Wimal Weerawansa, Minister of Construction, Engineering Services, Housing and Common Amenities, doby this Order : -",
