      458.65,
      539.94,
      481.72
    ],
    "text": "(b)direct that an outline Scheme shall be prepared for the whole of the area declared to be the \u201cSoragune KudaKataragama Devalaya Sacred Area\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
